WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Open the PDRA website.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.300
Click "Request access".

00:09.300 --> 00:12.500
Type your full name.

00:12.500 --> 00:16.700
Enter your email address. Your login details will be sent here.

00:16.700 --> 00:19.700
Enter your mobile number: 11 digits, starting with 09.

00:19.700 --> 00:24.000
Choose your barangay from the list.

00:24.000 --> 00:27.600
Your position is optional, but it helps CDRRMO confirm who you are.

00:27.600 --> 00:30.100
Check your details, then click "Submit Request".

00:30.100 --> 00:34.700
Done. Once CDRRMO approves your request, your username and password are emailed to you.
